00:04:11.697 --> 00:04:16.697
So, proteins are found inside
or on the surface of cells.

00:04:19.900 --> 00:04:23.120
And so they can be
bacterial cells or viruses

00:04:23.120 --> 00:04:24.700
or on the surface of your skin

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:27.320
or inside your skin or brain cells

00:04:27.320 --> 00:04:30.290
or any type of cell contains proteins.

00:04:30.290 --> 00:04:33.640
And these proteins perform
important functions in the cell

00:04:35.830 --> 00:04:38.923
which helps the cell to survive.

00:04:40.400 --> 00:04:44.223
