00:07:27.000 --> 00:07:29.430
that perform essential
functions in your cell

00:07:29.430 --> 00:07:31.660
to help your cell survive.

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:34.130
So it's like the machinery of your cell

00:07:34.130 --> 00:07:36.740
are performed by proteins.

00:07:36.740 --> 00:07:39.500
And so, what you can do

00:07:39.500 --> 00:07:41.390
so what I did as a structural biologist

00:07:41.390 --> 00:07:44.140
